{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/149108-followers-the-most-useless-of-birthrights","id":149108,"title":"Followers: The Most Useless of Birthrights","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-25T20:47:05-07:00","id":149108,"title":"Followers: The Most Useless of Birthrights","content":"I've been GM'ing Scion games for a while now, never getting to play, and I have yet to see followers to be truly useful in a game. They always end up dying pretty damn quickly, which renders the players who spend birthright points on them pretty pissed. I think the only time that followers became relevant to the game was when a Scion of Aengus had a retinue of medical professionals that did some decent work in keeping the team alive on their many journeys. Does anyone have any kind of house rules that make followers a viable birthright option? Creatures also seem to be sorta useless unless you have a 5-dot one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3045-nik","name":"Nik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T21:30:14-07:00","id":149133,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Retainers</b></span></span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Retainers are those who have been swept into the fate of the Scion, gaining their own legend score from the momentum of your story. This legend score is always one point less than the Scion they serve. Any given retainer can be a single person, a few people, or an entire group who operate as a single effective unit. Great examples of a retainer might be an extremely skilled butler, two hulking minotaurs, a group of flying horses, a full squad of loyal Einherjar, or an entire flock of flesh eating ravens.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Retainers start by choosing two abilities that thematically fit the role the player wishes them to serve. Use the </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>\u2018skilled\u2019</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> dice pool listed below whenever they roll one of these chosen abilities, and the </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>\u2018unskilled\u2019</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> dice pool on all other rolls. When it is mechanically necessary, they count as having attributes equal to their </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>\u2018unskilled\u2019</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> dice pool. A retainer acts on the same initiative as the Scion they serve, and regardless of how many people make up a retainer, they always share a single health, willpower, and legend pool.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Retainers can also become associated with Epic Attributes or Purviews. These are always at the maximum value for the legend score of the retainer (which is always one less than your own). Unlike a Scion, they only gain a single free knack or boon from each associated Epic Attribute or Purview while your character is a Hero, two from each when your character becomes a Demigod, and three from each when your character becomes a God.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Advancement</b></span></span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">When buying dots of Retainer, you may always choose to take a </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Perk</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> instead of gaining an </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Epic or Purview</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">. So it is possible for a single retainer to have up to eight perks. Retainers may be raised to a maximum of <b>5</b> at Hero, <b>8</b> at Demigod, and <b>11</b> at God.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Dots</b></span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Ability Advancement</b></span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Power Advancement</b></span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">8 dice on skilled rolls / 4 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Free Perk</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10 dice on skilled rolls / 5 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1 Epic or Purview</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">12 dice on skilled rolls / 6 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">4</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">14 dice on skilled rolls / 7 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Free Perk</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">5</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">16 dice on skilled rolls / 8 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2 Epics or Purviews</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">18 dice on skilled rolls / 9 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">7</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">20 dice on skilled rolls / 10 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Free Perk</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">8</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">22 dice on skilled rolls / 11 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3 Epics or Purviews</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">9</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">24 dice on skilled rolls / 12 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">26 dice on skilled rolls / 13 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Free Perk</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">11</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">28 dice on skilled rolls / 14 on unskilled rolls.</span></span></span></div></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\"> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">4 Epics or Purviews</span></span></span></div></td> </tr> </table></div> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Example Perks</b></span></span></span> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Gain two more </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Abilities</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> you wish to be <i>skilled</i> at.</span></span></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Gain two more </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Knacks</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> or </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Boons</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> you meet the prerequisites for.</span></span></span></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Gain a special ability such as </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Flight</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Increased Soak</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Resurrection</b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, or some other natural or supernatural ability unique to your retainer. The storyteller will determine the specific mechanical benefits of this special ability.</span></span></span></td> </tr> </table></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":484,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","user":"Iry","date":". 05-26-2014, 12:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T22:25:01-07:00","id":149145,"title":"","content":"This is beautiful, where does it come from?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3045-nik","name":"Nik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T22:35:33-07:00","id":149155,"title":"","content":"It's from our personal house rules project which we'll be releasing at the end of the month. The retainer fix was the first bit we ever did and had been play tested for months and works wonders","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T22:40:27-07:00","id":149156,"title":"","content":"Can't wait to see the rest!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3045-nik","name":"Nik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T22:41:13-07:00","id":149157,"title":"","content":"It's from Scion 2.0, a total system overhaul of the original game done mainly by Iry there. Here's a <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18IcvZDWbVVJ6yo58oY8zEYfAmOCMS1skw0saXzxgQQM/edit\" target=\"_blank\">link</a> to the current parts of it that are public, but a website is going to be released on May the first with all of the rules, current Purview / Knack rewrite projects, and some other goodies.<br /> <br /> Followers are, from my observation of archiving every single Follower/Creature used in our Scion 2.0 games (Combined into Retainers) to put up on the site for outside reference, the least used Birthright, interestingly. Not entirely sure why, because you can do some really fun stuff with the Retainer templates.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T23:11:38-07:00","id":149167,"title":"","content":"We've been trying out the retainer stuff since they first linked the house rules, and my group has been loving them. It pretty much works for almost every kind of creature or follower you could imagine, except wacky ones that you want to be weak in a bunch of areas for some reason.<br /> <br /> It's kinda weird saying retainer instead of creature or follower, but otherwise I give retainers an A+.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2447-twitchtherat","name":"TwitchTheRat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2447_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-25T23:30:45-07:00","id":149169,"title":"","content":"Awesome, I am very glad that you and your group have been getting some use out of the rules. Always be sure to poke us if there are any questions about them, or any of our other rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T09:02:39-07:00","id":149432,"title":"","content":"I eagerly await the website, although it is past May the first <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1071-raleel","name":"Raleel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T09:21:23-07:00","id":149441,"title":"","content":"Ah yeah, that's what I get for trying to explain everything at 3am. June first, that will be when the site will go up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T09:57:41-07:00","id":149459,"title":"","content":"Wow, the stuff you guys have put up for Scion 2.0 looks pretty damn nifty. It's interesting that you've chosen June 1 to launch the new site, seeing as John &amp; Anne are taking their site down the same day, from what I understand. Cool stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2775-varygoode","name":"varygoode","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T10:06:09-07:00","id":149464,"title":"","content":"The way I'd love to see Followers used is for groups to take advantage of their being underestimated by beings with Legend. Everyone expects that a Scion will be able to be a threat, whether in a social, physical, mystical, or what-have-you context. It's a lot easier to take followers for granted, but if you use them intelligently they can be really good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Games are a way for us to explore what it means to be human, or inhuman, as the case may be. Let's all have a good time playing them.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/400-guitarsniper","name":"guitarsniper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T10:09:51-07:00","id":149468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>varygoode</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/149108-followers-the-most-useless-of-birthrights?p=149459#post149459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, the stuff you guys have put up for Scion 2.0 looks pretty damn nifty. It's interesting that you've chosen June 1 to launch the new site, seeing as John &amp; Anne are taking their site down the same day, from what I understand. Cool stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>We deliberately chose June the 1st because we asked JSR if we could use some of their material (Knacks and Boons) and their God Associates; until we can work through all of our personal revisions. We've finished the Physical Epics, and Water, Animal, and Enech are completely revised. Atman (Deva PSP), Chaos, War, Pyschopomp, and Earth are nearly finished save for mechanics being hammered out; and most of the other purviews are complete in their Hero-level incarnations.<br /> <br /> qWhile I don't believe we'll have everything ready for the site-reveal, we wanted to give JSR this last month as a sort of acknowledgement of what that site was/is to Scion, and all the work and effort they put into the game. We're hoping to fill the shoes that JSR is leaving behind, and I'm going to be very sad when JSR goes offline.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":606,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","user":"Aynie","date":". 05-26-2014, 01:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T08:50:40-07:00","id":150384,"title":"","content":"Awesome. If John &amp; Anne are on board, you should ask them to promo/shout out your site. They have enormous shoes to fill!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2775-varygoode","name":"varygoode","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T11:37:45-07:00","id":150617,"title":"","content":"I made some tweaks in relation to number and power level to most of the &quot;support beings&quot; backgrounds (Followers, Guide, Familiar) in the Scion game i STed that had pretty interesting results overall. Will have to wait until i'm home to get the actual table, but i can say at the top you could get anything from a brigade of fanboys &amp; girls to a &quot;<a href=\"http://37.media.tumblr.com/63513478aecdec2c25057d7878bd2d77/tumblr_n15cyxO0YU1s6hi7io1_1280.png\" target=\"_blank\">band of brothers</a>&quot; quintet of lesser immortals companions, in the vein of the <a href=\"http://comicbookmovie.com/images/users/uploads/27306/FANDRAL_warriors_three_and_thor_051211.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">Warriors Three</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-27T21:50:49-07:00","id":151023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aynie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/149108-followers-the-most-useless-of-birthrights?p=149468#post149468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> We deliberately chose June the 1st because we asked JSR if we could use some of their material (Knacks and Boons) and their God Associates; until we can work through all of our personal revisions. We've finished the Physical Epics, and Water, Animal, and Enech are completely revised. Atman (Deva PSP), Chaos, War, Pyschopomp, and Earth are nearly finished save for mechanics being hammered out; and most of the other purviews are complete in their Hero-level incarnations.<br /> <br /> qWhile I don't believe we'll have everything ready for the site-reveal, we wanted to give JSR this last month as a sort of acknowledgement of what that site was/is to Scion, and all the work and effort they put into the game. We're hoping to fill the shoes that JSR is leaving behind, and I'm going to be very sad when JSR goes offline.</div> </div> </div> </div>JSR is going offline? I\u2019d better archive it, then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T09:08:01-07:00","id":151340,"title":"","content":"Someone already did. The WHOLE thing. (Thank god for search function). I can't find the link though. It might be on their new site.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T09:25:11-07:00","id":151356,"title":"","content":"It's in the &quot;JSR Compendium&quot; thread in the Announcements section of the Hero's Journey forums. I worry I'm not allowed to link it, so I won't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2775-varygoode","name":"varygoode","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T11:17:31-07:00","id":151492,"title":"","content":"I'm not worried about that: <a href=\"http://www.herosjourneyrpg.com/forum/showthread.php?tid=21\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.herosjourneyrpg.com/forum...ead.php?tid=21</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-28T11:42:49-07:00","id":151533,"title":"","content":"I managed to preserve the entire website so I could reference it in the future. Every picture, every PDF, every audio file, every piece of fiction, every blog entry, and every comment to every blog entry. Turns out to be a surprisingly robust 33 gigabytes!<br /> <br /> While we have permission to use a fair bit of their material, I am waiting to hear back about her god pronunciation chart. If she gives us the okay for that, we're definitely going to include it in <b>Scion 2.0.</b> Otherwise I will record my own pronunciations using hers as a reference, and I get to torture everybody with my voice! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/484-iry","name":"Iry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar484_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"346"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T10:56:26-07:00","id":160091,"title":"","content":"did the aforementioned sight on page 1 go up?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1584-oberon","name":"Oberon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-05T10:59:23-07:00","id":160094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Oberon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/149108-followers-the-most-useless-of-birthrights?p=160091#post160091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">did the aforementioned sight on page 1 go up?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/155803-scion-2-0-project\">Yup.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2775-varygoode","name":"varygoode","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2775_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"38"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-06T09:14:45-07:00","id":160889,"title":"","content":"We had a character with followers in my last game. They were a band of five aztec eagle warriors that he summoned with a drum. The two standard problems with followers were pretty easy to overcome:<br /> <br /> 1) Fragility. They were still pretty fragile, but every time he summoned they they were restored to full health so there was no fear of &quot;sorry, your dudes all died.&quot; Any GM who kills off followers that easily and doesn't also snap artifacts or assassinate guides has his priorities out of whack. If he does do all of those things, he very quickly finds himself with a group that simply refuses to make any attachments in the game.<br /> <br /> 2) Uselessness: they all had the knack that lets them instantly coordinate with others (Perfect Partner?). The PC had the knack as well so they could easily lower the enemies' DVs just by guarding for a tick or two. Their own spears weren't very useful most of the time, but they were incredible at support, which was why he got them in the first place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Need some online tools, including a Scion/Exalted battle wheel? <a href=\"http://rpg-tools.org/generators/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpg-tools.org/generators/index.php</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/829-james-mcmurray","name":"James McMurray","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}